7	// ONE-SITE-PER-PROFESSIONAL ASSUMPTION: Many keys below are namespaced by professionalId rather than siteId.
8	// This is intentional and correct for the current data model (each professional has exactly one site).
9	// If multi-site support is introduced, any key that caches site-scoped data under professionalId will need
